{"book":"dc","num":135,"verses":[{"en":"To seal the testimony of this book and the Book of Mormon, we announce the martyrdom of Joseph Smith the Prophet, and Hyrum Smith the Patriarch. They were shot in Carthage jail, on the 27th of June, 1844, about five o'clock p.m., by an armed mob—painted black—of from 150 to 200 persons. Hyrum was shot first and fell calmly, exclaiming: I am a dead man! Joseph leaped from the window, and was shot dead in the attempt, exclaiming: O Lord my God! They were both shot after they were dead, in a brutal manner, and both received four balls.","n":1,"sm":"Ina ia faamauina le molimau a lenei tusi ma le Tusi a Mamona, matou te faasilasila atu le faamaturoina o Iosefa Samita le Perofeta, ma Ailama Samita le Peteriaka. Sa tafanaina i laua i le falepuipui i Karefasi, i le aso 27 o Iuni, 1844, pe tusa o le itula e lima i le afiafi, e se vaega o tagata leaga faaauupegaina—na vali uli o latou mata—e tusa ma le 150 i le 200 tagata. Sa muamua ona fanaina o Ailama ma pa’ū filemu ai i lalo, ma alaga: O a’u o se tagata oti! Sa oso Iosefa mai le faamalama, ma sa fana ma oti ai i le taumafaiga, ma alaga: E, le Alii e, lo’u Atua! Sa toe fanaina i laua uma, i se ala sauā lava, ina ua mavae ona maliliu i laua, ma e ta’ifa pulu na tafana ai i laua uma.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ina"},{"en":"that","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faamauina"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"molimau"},{"en":"the testimony of","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"lenei"},{"en":"this book,","sm":"tusi"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Tusi"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"of Mormon.","sm":"Mamona,"},{"en":"we","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"·","sm":"faasilasila"},{"en":"after","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faamaturoina"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of Joseph;","sm":"Iosefa"},{"en":"","sm":"Samita"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the prophet,","sm":"Perofeta,"},{"en":"from","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"Ailama"},{"en":"","sm":"Samita"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},